# Public (NEXT_PUBLIC_*) values only — these are inlined into the browser
# bundle at build time regardless, so committing them here is no different
# from them being visible in devtools once deployed. This lets the server's
# `npm run build` step (see .cpanel.yml) always have them, with no manual
# copy/paste and no risk of a build silently shipping blank values.
#
# NEVER put secrets here (STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET, etc.) — those stay in cPanel's Node.js App
# environment variables, read at runtime, never baked into the build.

